                <pb facs="0187" n="81" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg81"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Wharton to Mr.
                            Pacheco</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-09-14"><hi rendition="#italic">September 14,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Wharton telegraphs that he is awaiting specific answer to his telegram of the
                    11th and first part of his telegram of the 4th, and that Mr. Pacheco’s telegram
                    of the 9th is unsatisfactory.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
